        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete with a variety of organizations that offer solutions and services competitive with those we offer—but we believe no other company offers the full range of services at scale that Accenture does, which uniquely positions us in a highly competitive market.",
