        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We help our clients create new, hyper-personalized experiences and services that are intelligently designed to foster loyalty and drive growth by making customer interactions more compelling, useful, and simple from initial interaction through ongoing customer service.",
